  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Pakistan 2024 &#x2013; Feasibility Study and Institutional Analysis (Local water management expert)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From June to October 2022 Pakistan was severely hit by a major climate-related disaster, a monster monsoon. This resulted into thousands of casualties and recovery, reconstruction and resilience needs of billions of USD. At the request of the Pakistani Government, the Netherlands, through the DRR-Team programme and the DRRS programme, reached out to several stakeholders, including the World Bank, to assess if the Netherlands could provide added value.</narrative>
  </description>
